OpenTyped OAPI modifications: independent object-input API; removal of Redocly loading
and bundling; package-local imports; OpenAPI 3.2 operation and streaming types;
schema resource resolution and private declarations for nested schema definitions.
The upstream transformation modules are retained together to make provenance
and future comparisons explicit. No upstream CLI or client runtime is included.
